.\" DO NOT MODIFY THIS FILE!  It was generated by help2man 1.49.3.
.TH UNATTR "8" "July 2024" "Unattr 1.0" "System Administration Utilities"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
Unattr \- remove choosen xattr from files, recursively.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B unattr
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,<FILE|DIRECTORY>\/\fR...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Remove choosen xattr from files, recursively.
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-attr\fR
specify the name of a new attribute
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
show version number and copyright
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.TP
Remove shake xattrs :
.B unattr
\--attr=shake.ptime
.I FILES
.TP
Remove beagle xattrs :
.B unattr
\-a Beagle.MTime \-a Beagle.AttrTime \-a Beagle.Fingerprint
\-a Beagle.Uid
.I FILES
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
Report bugs to <brice.arnould+shake@gmail.com> or at
https://github.com/unbrice/shake/issues
